  "status": "Research comparison completed; do not replace the original reconstruction or add a production option.",
  "hypothesis": "The RT1 field currently minimizes distance to the P1 cell field under the original normal-trace and weak-divergence constraints. Targeting the existing P2 velocity potential might reduce curvature-related source and transport error without changing those constraints.",
  "method": {
    "original": "R1(v)=argmin_z ||z-v_T||_L2 subject to every original face P1 normal trace, radial normal continuity and triangle P1 divergence equal to the original cell weak divergence.",
    "candidate": "R2(v)=argmin_z ||z-r_T^2(v)||_L2 under exactly the same constraints; r_T^2 is the existing P2 potential. Only the objective RHS changes; matrix, constraint coefficients/targets, pressure B/-B^T, viscous operator and quality gate stay unchanged.",
    "patchFile": "artifacts/current/native-laminar-potential-lift.patch",
    "source": {
      "baseSha256": "13e10da27510c87612910035f515e120b96a88608a05a032090883905854810f",
      "candidateSha256": "82527aa52fc543d7a6a2d28a601a67949edbe05dc036d764d1d414da7d0e4468",
      "onlyChange": "L2 closest target inside RT1 constraints: original P1 cell polynomial to existing P2 potential",
      "productFilesChanged": false
    },
    "pressureCompatibilityReason": "Difference R2-R1 has zero divergence and normal trace, so its integral against a gradient is zero by integration by parts (up to the actual quadrature/roundoff). This is a structural derivation, not a proof of general new-method convergence.",
    "nonlinearScope": "Candidate R2 was consistently used for source, advecting/transported/test velocity, and original load evaluation in the experimental executable. NS gains cannot be attributed to the source or transport change separately.",
    "reference": {
      "url": "https://arxiv.org/html/2203.07180v3",
      "use": "Section 2.4 gives the constrained H(div) reconstruction and Section 3 applies it to force/transport. P2 objective here is an experimental modification derived for this code; no inherited theorem or paper-author endorsement is claimed."
    },
    "isolation": "Generate one temporary modified native kernel from an exact patch and link its object before the native static libraries. No production kernel/API/default or large cloud input was changed."
  },
